<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Student Feedback System</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Student Feedback System</h1>
      <p>Admin and student portal for collecting and analyzing academic feedback.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button" href="/admin/login">Admin Login</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/student/login">Student Login</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container section-card">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Admins register with faculty details, ID photo, and role.</li>
      <li>Students log in with roll number, department, and attendance.</li>
      <li>Feedback is submitted anonymously and shown to admins only.</li>
      <li>Charts show positive, negative, and neutral feedback trends.</li>
    </ul>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <p>Designed for the Student Feedback System project.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
